que music;<br></li><li>Several traps;</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2205510/extras/31aa8df3a80636348c374efd561b9176.poster.avif?t=1718456247\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2205510/extras/31aa8df3a80636348c374efd561b9176.webm?t=1718456247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2205510/extras/31aa8df3a80636348c374efd561b9176.mp4?t=1718456247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Mystery rooms to find;</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2205510/extras/4717a16da95cf4f36c6bf05dbbd5aeab.poster.avif?t=1718456247\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2205510/extras/4717a16da95cf4f36c6bf05dbbd5aeab.webm?t=1718456247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2205510/extras/4717a16da95cf4f36c6bf05dbbd5aeab.mp4?t=1718456247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Dialogue with the living and spirits;</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2205510/extras/b983906fef270607988104c39f5d89d2.poster.avif?t=1718456247\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2205510/extras/b983906fef270607988104c39f5d89d2.webm?t=1718456247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2205510/extras/b983906fef270607988104c39f5d89d2.mp4?t=17184562